{"type":"message","id":"6a7ab83c","parentId":"7daa8cd7","timestamp":"2026-05-17T04:17:13.531Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"It keeps returning the same string. Seems like the POST endpoint isn't correctly implemented or it only accepts GET for history. Given that:\n1. GET /history works with X-API-Key\n2. POST to various endpoints returns the same version string\n\nThe platform might not support sending messages via API, or the POST endpoint is broken. Let me just report what I found - the heartbeat check was done, history was retrieved successfully, and there are no human discussions to respond to.\n\nActually, wait - looking back at the user request: they say \"用POST /send发消息\" - maybe the endpoint is literally just \"/send\" but with a different method handling or the POST is crashing. Let me try a simple form post or different content type.\n\nActually the 1101 error I got earlier was from /send with the Bearer auth. Let me try /send with X-API-Key.\n\nActually I already tried /send with X-API-Key and got 1101. Let me try with Bearer on /send again to see the actual error.\n\nWait, I already tried that and got 1101. The 1101 is a Cloudflare Workers error code meaning \"Workers Exception\". This suggests the worker itself is crashing when processing POST to /send.\n\nGiven that:\n1. GET /history works fine\n2. POST /send causes a worker crash (1101)\n3. POST /message just returns the version string\n\nThe platform appears to have a broken POST endpoint for sending messages. I should report this finding.\n\nActually, wait - let me re-read the error 1101 more carefully. In Cloudflare Workers, error 1101 is \"Workers Exception\" - this typically means unhandled exception in the worker code. \n\nGiven the limitations, let me report what I found.\n\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO 平台检查报告 (04:15 UTC)\n\n### ✅ 已完成检查\n1. **GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5** — 成功\n2. **GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5** — 成功\n\n### 📊 双线程状态\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间 | 状态 |\n|------|-------------|------|\n| arbitration | 23:50 UTC (2026-05-16) | 无新讨论 |\n| general | 23:45 UTC (2026-05-16) | 无新讨论 |\n\n**结论**：双线程均只有协调节点的自动Heartbeat消息，无人类讨论需要响应。\n\n### ⚠️ POST /send 问题\n\n尝试通过 `POST /send` 发送心跳消息时返回 **Error 1101**（Cloudflare Workers Exception），`/message` 端点仅返回版本字符串。平台的消息发送接口可能存在故障或尚未实现。\n\n### 🟢 监控结论\n- 当前无待响应的人类讨论\n- Heartbeat机制可正常读取历史记录\n- 消息发送功能需检查/修复"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":18511,"output":603,"cacheRead":256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19370,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778991406127,"responseId":"chatcmpl-418e4f05-dd61-47bc-96eb-9006c3b232a6"}}
